{"synopsis":"Dipanggil ke dunia di mana seni ilahi dan seni bela diri hidup berdampingan, Qiao Mu dapat hidup kembali tanpa batas dan naik level. Semakin tragis kematiannya, semakin kuat dia menjadi setelah dia dihidupkan kembali. Musuh-musuhnya terkejut ketika menyadari bahwa setelah mengalahkan seorang pria muda, seorang pria yang lebih tua muncul, mengulang tanpa batas! Rumor mulai menyebar tentang keluarga Qiao yang legendaris… Tunggu, tidak ada yang bilang kalau menghidupkan kembali membuat saya lebih tua!","alternative_title":"Duō Shā Wǒ Jǐ Cì, Wǒ Jiù Wúdíle Kill Me a Few More Times and I Will Be Invincible More Death Makes Me Invincible The More I Die, the More Invincible I Become 多杀我几次，我就无敌了","author":"刺猬猫","artist":"刺猬猫","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f732b01f-d8a7-4809-9293-46c7ff0c9aac","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2025-05-28","released":"2025-05-28"},{"chapter_id":"16e91ea1-2c70-45b7-b3b4-cef85a52dc7a","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2025-05-28","released":"2025-05-28"},{"chapter_id":"31fe2aa5-445d-4089-91bd-71fb208166e5","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2025-05-25","released":"2025-05-25"},{"chapter_id":"a320a93d-054d-4d06-974d-cfb80cbde218","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2025-05-24","released":"2025-05-24"},{"chapter_id":"932013e7-e69f-4e63-95c8-82fef5fd2a2b","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2025-04-08","released":"2025-04-08"},{"chapter_id":"f6f8d5f8-951f-4a93-9426-b3f9fa4a010d","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2025-04-08","released":"2025-04-08"},{"chapter_id":"cf814d6c-a103-439d-93b4-1aa0611201da","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2025-03-26","released":"2025-03-26"},{"chapter_id":"7e5a7274-27b0-4c5c-993a-429e563c73d8","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2025-03-25","released":"2025-03-25"},{"chapter_id":"21bcfc99-d2d5-4975-a374-519b5153a56d","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2025-03-25","released":"2025-03-25"},{"chap